  "text": "@daniel_nguyenx 👋 1h prompt cache is nuanced actually. It costs more for cache writes, and less for cache reads. Whether you benefit from cheaper cache reads depends on your usage pattern -- context window size, whether the query is the main agent or subagent, etc.\n\nWe have been testing a",
